---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How Multi-Agent AI is Transforming Agency Landing Page Workflows | PixelPage Blog"
  description="Discover how marketing agencies are using specialized copywriter, designer, and compliance AI agents to ship client pages 10x faster."
>
  <Nav />

  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-sans">
    <header class="mb-10 text-center">
      <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-400 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-violet-500/10 border border-violet-500/20">
        Agency Growth
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-4">
        How Multi-Agent AI is Transforming Agency Landing Page Workflows
      </h1>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs text-gray-400 pb-6 border-b border-white/10">
        <span>By PixelPage Strategy Team</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>July 22, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>5 min read</span>
        </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed pt-6">
        <p class="text-base text-gray-200 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Marketing agencies face constant pressure to ship landing pages quickly for ad campaigns. Traditional workflows require copywriters, designers, and developers working sequentially — often taking weeks. Multi-agent AI eliminates these bottlenecks.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight pt-4">1. The Multi-Agent Architecture</h2>
        <p>
          Single-prompt LLMs often produce generic copy or mismatched designs. PixelPage solves this by deploying three specialized AI agents that execute specialized functions concurrently:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-gray-300">
          <li><strong>Copywriter Agent:</strong> Analyzes product briefs or scraped ad URLs to generate high-converting PAS/AIDA copy.</li>
          <li><strong>Designer Agent:</strong> Matches copy with pre-built component templates from your library.</li>
          <li><strong>Compliance Agent:</strong> Scans copy against Meta and Google ad policies to flag potential risks.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight pt-4">2. Enforcing Client Brand Guidelines</h2>
        <p>
          One of the biggest challenges for growing agencies is managing multiple brand identities simultaneously. With PixelPage's Brand Kit engine, account managers can lock in client primary colors, secondary accents, logos, and Google Fonts — ensuring every AI-generated landing page aligns perfectly with brand guidelines.rating an average 38% increase in conversion rates while eliminating frontend developer bottlenecks.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/10 mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Ready to test multi-agent AI for your agency?</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Generate your first landing page free in under 2 minutes.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/chat" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-500 text-white shadow-lg">
            Start Free Generator Studio →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
